---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ArrowLeft } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="OptimListing Terms of Service"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24">
    <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-sm !text-muted-foreground hover:!text-foreground transition duration-150">
      <ArrowLeft class="w-4 h-auto" /> back to homepage
    </a>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bricolage font-bold text-foreground mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-8">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-sm text-muted-foreground max-w-none space-y-6">
      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By using OptimListing ("the Service"), you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
      <p>
        OptimListing provides AI-powered marketplace listing optimization for SHopify, Etsy, eBay and Amazon. The Service includes manual listing optimization, and (in the future) bulk optimization features.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Account Registration</h2>
      <p>
        You must provide accurate and complete information when creating an account. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You must be at least 18 years old to use the Service.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Subscription and Billing</h2>
      <p>
        OptimListing offers Free, Starter ($9/month), and Professional ($16/month) plans. Paid subscriptions are billed monthly through Dodo Payments. You may cancel your subscription at any time. No refunds are provided for partial months. Upon cancellation, you retain access until the end of your current billing period.
      </p>

      <h2>5. AI-Generated Content</h2>
      <p>
        Our AI provides optimization suggestions based on marketplace SEO best practices. While we strive for accuracy, we do not guarantee that optimized listings will result in increased sales, views, or rankings. You are responsible for reviewing and approving all AI-generated content before publishing to your marketplace.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose or in violation of marketplace terms of service.</li>
        <li>Attempt to circumvent usage limits or subscription tiers.</li>
        <li>Resell or redistribute the Service without authorization.</li>
        <li>Upload malicious content or attempt to disrupt the Service.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        The Service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. OptimListing shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of the Service, including but not limited to lost sales or marketplace penalties.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Termination</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms. You may delete your account at any time through the Settings page. Upon deletion, all your data is permanently removed.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms. We will notify active users of material changes via email.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about these Terms, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:support@optimlisting.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">support@optimlisting.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
  strong {
    color: var(--text-muted-foreground);
  }
  h2, a {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }
</style>
